{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-solovay-self-reference.md","title":"Self-Referential Solovay Construction","display":"lem-solovay-self-reference — Self-Referential Solovay Construction","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-solovay-self-reference","aliases":["89-lem-solovay-self-reference"],"display":"lem-solovay-self-reference — Self-Referential Solovay Construction","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-sigma-one-formula]]","[[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]]","[[89-df-solovay-function]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-solovay-self-reference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-solovay-self-reference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-solovay-self-reference — Self-Referential Solovay Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"571230a8af3bcd56\" href=\"?note=571230a8af3bcd56\" title=\"89-df-sigma-one-formula\">89-df-sigma-one-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d\" href=\"?note=4a8ab8e4bad7b12d\" title=\"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma\">89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2b62c1bcece60ed\" href=\"?note=b2b62c1bcece60ed\" title=\"89-df-solovay-function\">89-df-solovay-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8811191242063297\" href=\"?note=8811191242063297\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-semantics\">89-df-arithmetical-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\">\\(R\\subseteq (W\\times W)\\)</span> 传递、非自反，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)\">\\(\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\">\\(W&#39;=W\\cup\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\">\\(R&#39;=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathsf{pad}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathsf{pad}\\)</span> 取本书固定编码与内部图表示。PA 证明单个证明码的末结论唯一；候选句子组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\">\\(\\vec U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\">\\(a,b,c\\)</span> 是互异的对象语言数变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k,j\">\\(m,k,j\\)</span> 是元自然数。显示的公式实例化避免捕获，先将局部绑定变量统一改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R&#39;\">\\(R&#39;\\)</span> 上的有限折叠按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,j)\">\\((i,j)\\)</span> 的字典序，空析取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，空合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=0\">\\(0=0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SolData}\">\\(\\mathsf{SolData}\\)</span> 的候选域为本条显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,R\">\\(n,R\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(W&#39;)^\\omega\">\\(h\\in(W&#39;)^\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\">\\(\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\)</span>。其环境中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\">\\(a,b,c\\)</span>、PA 枚举程序和证明公式始终固定为本条同一组数据。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nH(t,u)&amp;\\coloneqq H[a:=t,b:=u]\\quad(H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(H)\\subseteq\\{a,b\\},\\ t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\land b=\\bar j\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&amp;\\coloneqq b=c\\land\\bigwedge_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\lor\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b),\\\\\n\\exists h\\in(W&#39;)^{\\mathbb N}\\ \\exists H\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\ \\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\quad&amp;\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad S_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H[b:=\\bar j]),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b(H\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H[a:=0]\\leftrightarrow b=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H[a:=Sa]\\leftrightarrow\\exists c(H[b:=c]\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr),\\\\\nh(0)=0,\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad\n(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\to h(m+1)=j,\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\ \\neg(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\bigr)\\to h(m+1)=h(m),\\\\\n\\forall m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models H[a:=\\bar m,b:=\\bar k]\\Longleftrightarrow h(m)=k.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nH(t,u)&amp;\\coloneqq H[a:=t,b:=u]\\quad(H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(H)\\subseteq\\{a,b\\},\\ t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\land b=\\bar j\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&amp;\\coloneqq b=c\\land\\bigwedge_{(i,j)\\in R&#39;}\n(c=\\bar i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\lor\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b),\\\\\n\\exists h\\in(W&#39;)^{\\mathbb N}\\ \\exists H\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\ \\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\quad&amp;\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad S_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H[b:=\\bar j]),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b(H\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H[a:=0]\\leftrightarrow b=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H[a:=Sa]\\leftrightarrow\\exists c(H[b:=c]\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr),\\\\\nh(0)=0,\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad\n(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\to h(m+1)=j,\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\ \\neg(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\bigr)\\to h(m+1)=h(m),\\\\\n\\forall m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models H[a:=\\bar m,b:=\\bar k]\\Longleftrightarrow h(m)=k.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(h\\in(W&#39;)^{\\omega})\\land(H\\in\\Sigma_1^{\\mathrm{PA}})\\land(\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad S_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H[b:=\\bar j])\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b(H\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H[a:=0]\\leftrightarrow b=0)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H[a:=Sa]\\leftrightarrow\\exists c(H[b:=c]\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(h(0)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad\n(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\to h(m+1)=j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\ \\neg(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\bigr)\\to h(m+1)=h(m)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models H[a:=\\bar m,b:=\\bar k]\\Longleftrightarrow h(m)=k\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\exists h\\in(W&#39;)^\\omega\\ \\exists H\\in\\Sigma_1^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\ \\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(h\\in(W&#39;)^{\\omega})\\land(H\\in\\Sigma_1^{\\mathrm{PA}})\\land(\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad S_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H[b:=\\bar j])\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b(H\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H[a:=0]\\leftrightarrow b=0)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H[a:=Sa]\\leftrightarrow\\exists c(H[b:=c]\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(h(0)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in W&#39;\\quad\n(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\to h(m+1)=j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W&#39;\\ \\neg(h(m)R&#39;j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\bigr)\\to h(m+1)=h(m)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models H[a:=\\bar m,b:=\\bar k]\\Longleftrightarrow h(m)=k\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\exists h\\in(W&#39;)^\\omega\\ \\exists H\\in\\Sigma_1^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\ \\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原包来源标注为 Boolos，第 9 章 pp.124–128；本轮只取得 Markdown 压缩包，未重新核验书页图像。</p>\n<p>本条保留自指构造的存在性结论，未把标准模型中的外延正确性当成 PA 内递归等价。Move、Stay、Step 是显式的有限对象公式族；数值阶段使用 m，与对象变量 a 分开。单个证明码的唯一末结论保证每一步至多触发一个不同的目标句码。H 的有限历史编码及带参数对角化给出存在性；这里不是证明助手中的机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-sigma-one-formula","status":"resolved","id":"571230a8af3bcd56","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-sigma-one-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-solovay-function","status":"resolved","id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8811191242063297","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq (W\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall j\\in W\\setminus\\{1\\}\\ (1Rj)","display":false},{"tex":"W'=W\\cup\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R'=R\\cup(\\{0\\}\\times W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathsf{pad}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"m,k,j","display":false},{"tex":"R'","display":false},{"tex":"(i,j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"0=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SolData}","display":false},{"tex":"n,R","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in(W')^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nH(t,u)&\\coloneqq H[a:=t,b:=u]\\quad(H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\ \\mathrm{FV}(H)\\subseteq\\{a,b\\},\\ t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{(i,j)\\in R'}\n(c=\\bar i\\land b=\\bar j\\land\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&\\coloneqq b=c\\land\\bigwedge_{(i,j)\\in R'}\n(c=\\bar i\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg U_j\\urcorner})),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Move}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b)\\lor\\mathrm{Stay}_{\\vec U}(a,c,b),\\\\\n\\exists h\\in(W')^{\\mathbb N}\\ \\exists H\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\ \\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\quad&\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\forall j\\in W'\\quad S_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H[b:=\\bar j]),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b(H\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H[a:=0]\\leftrightarrow b=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H[a:=Sa]\\leftrightarrow\\exists c(H[b:=c]\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr),\\\\\nh(0)=0,\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in W'\\quad\n(h(m)R'j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\to h(m+1)=j,\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W'\\ \\neg(h(m)R'j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\bigr)\\to h(m+1)=h(m),\\\\\n\\forall m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models H[a:=\\bar m,b:=\\bar k]\\Longleftrightarrow h(m)=k.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(h\\in(W')^{\\omega})\\land(H\\in\\Sigma_1^{\\mathrm{PA}})\\land(\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{FV}(H)=\\{a,b\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W'\\quad S_j=\\exists c\\,\\forall a\\,(a\\ge c\\to H[b:=\\bar j])\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\,\\exists!b\\,H\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b(H\\to\\bigvee_{i=0}^n b=\\bar i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall b(H[a:=0]\\leftrightarrow b=0)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\forall a\\forall b\n\\bigl(H[a:=Sa]\\leftrightarrow\\exists c(H[b:=c]\\land\\mathrm{Step}_{\\vec S}(a,c,b))\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(h(0)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in W'\\quad\n(h(m)R'j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\to h(m+1)=j\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\bigl(\\forall j\\in W'\\ \\neg(h(m)R'j\\land(m,\\ulcorner\\neg S_j\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\bigr)\\to h(m+1)=h(m)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\bigl(\\forall m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathbb N\\models H[a:=\\bar m,b:=\\bar k]\\Longleftrightarrow h(m)=k\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\exists h\\in(W')^\\omega\\ \\exists H\\in\\Sigma_1^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\ \\exists\\vec S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{n+1}\\ \\mathsf{SolData}(n,R,h,H,\\vec S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5224,"backlinks":[{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 9 章，印刷页 124–127；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限有序候选集有唯一最小元，原始递归给出唯一总函数。该参数化递归本身不要求 $L(v)$ 就是它的极限句；实现原书忠实性所需的自指相容构造另见 [[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]。因此不把任意句族的此递归当作已完成的 Solovay 反解释。原跨书线性序原子定义的是非严格序，这里直接用有限枚举诱导严格序。"},{"id":"2adc36a611449e23","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$h,H,S_0,\\ldots,S_n,W',R'$ 是 [[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] 给出的同一组见证，包含 H 的 PA 内总性、唯一性、有限值域、初值及递归等价，$S_j$ 取该 H 的规范极限句。"},{"id":"1e36ef17b6856ad1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]] → [[89-lem-solovay-limit-properties]] → [[89-lem-solovay-truth]] → [[89-lem-solovay-lem2]] → [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-companion]] → [[89-thm-gls-completeness]] → [[89-cor-gls-decidable]] → [[89-thm-uniform-solovay-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","571230a8af3bcd56","4a8ab8e4bad7b12d","b2b62c1bcece60ed","c6ab46cd662b1409","7f53d84c2164d9c5","76cab88fafa3b379","8811191242063297"]}